{"title":"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two standard six-sided dice are rolled. If the two numbers on the top faces are added, which of the following sums is least likely?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef7961c2d225cd3cd22c5e1e5ee439fca5493c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 9\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"369\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can list the ways that we can obtain each sum, and then see which has the lowest number of possibilities:\n</p><p>Option A: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/eca5cdd1fae944f5747459c175d27f503cb6a461.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/2/29286174cbbd7de6698aae9f18900476d6c684f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b04053a14e3122e4a9e5a78ea383297b25c9d542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/8/ae800ea81faee0fad54655543a135f9abbef836f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4ebae376d2b5c7ffd7518f74221676ee2ca0ff23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a525fd8c33667fadc53bfbf182ac111c5ea76d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Option B: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/981e0f8a595145c7a4babb3d670f281866edb2a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d899f75d45ace00b3fc81481ad33201c4980cef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/d/bddc92ac303c9b266014be7a4acfd91864c18eb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/8/f88cd4e438f5a5bb0430f621102e55f1ba1112f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/c/61ce48fd2da015eda822f9a53d1e027c32b27b03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Option C: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/ccc4c1d30eb252b3051f06906ed7666373a1cbb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae167999b454f3487a94eb2fdb22c3999109eb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c835826a05a3437e28c3a3627827c2294f7890d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/fae18aff6eff68c82ae0497e0ca4380e26321520.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Option D: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0ebd2ef3ed0bf6fd35ab7c690324f2aae278af77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7d0a683c29abfacd3dfeef48c6fd0d08be6a3d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/5364104b6c3e66a26266f0dee7a38e484a68cf61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Option E: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d82c121a37e9515b092c32d6b93e63b0cc8a61c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/8/558d72dc6e35b7d94fe71c65099d5d712d8ddeed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We can then see that the lowest number of possibilities came from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/c/dfc1f49dce8a822c719603dab4c2e631a317af71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher (format from any1sgame)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that the number of possible sums decreases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> each time past <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because each roll can only go from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less possibility for the first roll each time.\n</p><p>Thus, the lowest number of possibilities of the answers would come from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/c/dfc1f49dce8a822c719603dab4c2e631a317af71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 18\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 18</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Prob